  "title": "Tizeti declares first dividend of 2.00 NGN for year ended December 2021",
  "summary": "Pioneer solar-based internet service provider in West Africa, Tizeti Network Limited, is set to pay its shareholders its first dividend after it declared a dividend of N2.00 per share in respect of the financial year, ending December 31st, 2021. According to a statement by the company, the company has been profitable in three out of the last four years and […]",
